        "original_id": "8ab2a295-b73f-51a4-a814-447ae74c43fd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: FC Barcelona, AC Milan, UEFA Champions League\n- People: Daniele Massaro, Dejan Savićević, Marcel Desailly\n- Events: 1993–94 FC Barcelona season, UEFA Champions League final\n- Concepts: football, forward\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1993–94 season, FC Barcelona retained domestic league supremacy and reached the UEFA Champions League final in one of the club's most successful seasons.\n- In the 1993–94 UEFA Champions League final, AC Milan defeated FC Barcelona 4–0.\n- In that final, Daniele Massaro, Dejan Savićević, and Marcel Desailly scored for AC Milan.\n- Daniele Emilio Massaro was born on 23 May 1961.\n- Daniele Emilio Massaro is an Italian former footballer.\n- Daniele Emilio Massaro played as a forward.",
